  "summary": "MSUI implements the bounded production repairs and strong draw/state/input telemetry while retaining the existing packed core, horizontal seats, assignment model, token art, high-resolution portrait, and always-on bottom multibars. The preserved MSUI pet portrait is now physically interactive: left click targets and right click opens current Benilla's PET menu. Its dialogs use the shared rule-owned StaticPopup coordinator, including the two-slot rename chain and exact abandon/dismiss/rename wire contracts. Connected live-session render/diff and user-visible proof remain open.",
